{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Stockfish Chess Analysis Service API",
    "description": "## Stockfish 国际象棋无状态深度分析服务（API 指南与约束）\n\n面向移动端与 AI Agent 的高性能国际象棋分析服务。所有接口均为纯无状态设计，服务端不存储对局记录或用户数据。\n\n### 核心物理量与度量口径（AI 调用必须遵循）：\n1. **统一行棋方视角（Root Perspective）**：\n   - 所有的分数值（score）与胜平负概率（wdl）均恒从**当前请求根局面的走子方（Side to Move）**视角给出：\n   - 正值（+）表示当前走子方优势，负值（-）表示劣势。\n2. **单位度量**：\n   - `cp`：厘兵（centipawns），100 cp = 1 个兵。\n   - `mate`：将杀步数，正数为我方将杀对手，负数为我方被对手将杀。\n   - `wdl`：胜平负千分比，win + draw + loss = 1000。\n3. **局面重构约束（Threefold Repetition）**：\n   - 请求必须携带 `initialFen` 加上完整的历史 UCI 走法列表 `moves`，服务端从初始局面推演，以准确识别**三次重复局面**和五十步和棋规则。\n4. **同深度对拍（Fair Comparison）**：\n   - `/sf/v1/analyze-move` 会双路并行对根局面搜索最佳候选与实战走法 `playedMove`；\n   - 最终比对保证在两者的**共同完成深度（commonDepth）**下对齐，绝不跨深度比较。\n   - `diffCp = played.score.value - best.score.value`：通常为 <= 0，表示走这一步相较最佳着法的厘兵损失。\n\n### 分析档位（Profiles）：\n- **`lightning`（极速档，推荐 AI 对话场景使用）**：纯基于目标深度 22 层驱动，**严格搜满 22 层即停，不设时间预算限制**（仅保留 60s 异常安全兜底），单候选 + 实战走法双路并行推演。\n- **`fast`（快档）**：纯基于目标深度 22 层驱动，严格搜满 22 层即停，不限时间预算，双候选 MultiPV=2。\n- **`standard`（标准档）**：时间预算 4.0 秒，深度上限 128，双候选。\n- **`deep`（深度档）**：纯基于时间预算驱动（4.0 秒），不限制层数（深度上限 128），进行充分深入推演（通常可达 24~30+ 层）。\n- **`ultra`（超深档）**：纯基于时间预算驱动（10.0 秒），不限制层数（深度上限 128），用于关键着法极限推演。\n\n### 开局定式与残局库扩展能力：\n1. **开局定式识别（`opening`）**：\n   - 服务端内置完整 ECO 开局前缀树，自动返回当前局面所处的定式名称（如 `name: \"西班牙开局 柏林防御\"`）、定式标记（`theory: true/false`）及定式匹配半步序。\n2. **Syzygy 3-4-5 残局库（Tablebase）**：\n   - 服务端常驻挂载 Syzygy 3-4-5 残局表，3-5 子局面可瞬间命中查表，深度直接穿透至 72~128 层，并在 `stats.tbhits` 返回残局库探测命中次数。\n\n### 全盘复盘与整局批量分析（Batch Game Review）：\n提供 `/sf/v1/review` 与 `/sf/v1/analyze-game` 端点（两者等价互为别名），用于对整盘对局进行多核高并发并行复盘：\n1. **两种批量提交方式**：\n   - **方式 A（推荐，精确）**：直接传入 UCI 着法列表 `moves: [\"e2e4\", \"e7e5\", \"g1f3\", ...]`，可配合可选的 `initialFen`（用于残局、打谱或特殊开局）。\n   - **方式 B（便捷，直传）**：直接传入原始 PGN 字符串 `pgn: \"1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 ...\"`，服务端自动解析着法序列与起始 FEN。\n2. **高并发并行调度机制**：\n   - 服务端启动轻量多 Worker 引擎池（20 核主机默认分配 16 路独立单线程引擎，满核并行推演），在目标深度 22 层下以约 4 步/秒的极速吞吐消化整盘棋；\n   - 89 步实战对局冷启动复盘耗时仅约 22 秒，历史已分析步数走 SQLite 磁盘缓存（<1ms 瞬时命中）；\n   - 并发分析完成后，所有 Worker 引擎自动销毁并触发垃圾回收，零常驻系统资源浪费。\n3. **返回数据与统计指标**：\n   - `summary.whiteAccuracy` / `summary.blackAccuracy`：白方与黑方的全局综合着法准确率百分比（0.0 ~ 100.0%）；\n   - `summary.whiteAcpl` / `summary.blackAcpl`：双方法定平均厘兵损失（ACPL）；\n   - `summary.whiteJudgments` / `summary.blackJudgments`：双方法定六级着法评语统计分布（🌟best, 👍excellent, 🆗good, ⚠️inaccuracy, ❓mistake, ❌blunder）；\n   - `moves`：逐步对拍详情列表，包含每步实战走法、最佳推荐走法、厘兵亏损 `diffCp`、单步准确率 `accuracy`、着法评语 `judgment` 及单步计算耗时。\n\n### 辅助棋力评语分类标准（供 AI 解说棋步）：\n- `diffCp == 0` 或 `played == best`：🌟 最佳着法 (Best Move)\n- `-15 <= diffCp < 0`：✅ 优秀着法 (Excellent)\n- `-40 <= diffCp < -15`：👍 良好着法 (Good)\n- `-100 <= diffCp < -40`：⚠️ 轻微缓着 (Inaccuracy)\n- `-250 <= diffCp < -100`：❓ 疑问着 / 错误 (Mistake)\n- `diffCp < -250`：❌ 严重大漏 (Blunder)\n",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "paths": {
    "/sf/v1/health": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Stockfish Analysis"
        ],
        "summary": "Health",
        "description": "查询分析引擎就绪状态、配置参数与上限。",
        "operationId": "health_sf_v1_health_get",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "type": "object",
                  "title": "Response Health Sf V1 Health Get"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/sf/v1/release": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Stockfish Analysis"
        ],
        "summary": "Release Engines",
        "description": "主动释放 Stockfish 引擎常驻内存（关闭子进程并归还约 1.5GB 内存）。",
        "operationId": "release_engines_sf_v1_release_post",
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "additionalProperties": true,
                  "type": "object",
                  "title": "Response Release Engines Sf V1 Release Post"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/sf/v1/analyze-move": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Stockfish Analysis"
        ],
        "summary": "Analyze Move",
        "description": "一次完成最佳走法、第二候选与实战走法的同深度对拍。",
        "operationId": "analyze_move_sf_v1_analyze_move_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AnalyzeMoveRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/AnalyzeMoveResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/sf/v1/evaluate": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Stockfish Analysis"
        ],
        "summary": "Evaluate",
        "description": "返回任意局面的综合评价与候选走法列表。",
        "operationId": "evaluate_sf_v1_evaluate_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EvaluateRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EvaluateResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/sf/v1/analyze-game": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Stockfish Analysis"
        ],
        "summary": "Review Game",
        "description": "对整局人类对局进行全盘高并发多核并行复盘，返回每步同深度对比、评语与全局统计。",
        "operationId": "review_game_sf_v1_analyze_game_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReviewGameRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReviewGameResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "/sf/v1/review": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Stockfish Analysis"
        ],
        "summary": "Review Game",
        "description": "对整局人类对局进行全盘高并发多核并行复盘，返回每步同深度对比、评语与全局统计。",
        "operationId": "review_game_sf_v1_review_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReviewGameRequest"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful Response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ReviewGameResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "Validation Error",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HTTPValidationError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "AnalyzeMoveRequest": {
        "properties": {
          "requestId": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Requestid",
            "description": "请求唯一标识，便于跟踪或取消。"
          },
          "position": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PositionInput",
            "description": "待分析着法落子前的局面历史。"
          },
          "playedMove": {
            "type": "string",
            "title": "Playedmove",
            "description": "实战走出的单步 UCI 着法（如 f1c4）。"
          },
          "profile": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Profile",
            "description": "预设档位（lightning / fast / standard / deep / ultra）。",
            "default": "deep"
          },
          "limits": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MoveAnalysisLimits"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "搜索预算限制；若省略则继承 profile 或标准深度 128。"
          },
          "multiPv": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer",
                "maximum": 10.0,
                "minimum": 1.0
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Multipv",
            "description": "首阶段多候选线数（若省略则继承 profile：lightning 默认为 1，其余默认为 2）。"
          },
          "maxPvPlies": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer",
                "maximum": 64.0,
                "minimum": 1.0
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Maxpvplies",
            "description": "返回 PV 的最大步数截断（默认 12）。",
            "default": 12
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "position",
          "playedMove"
        ],
        "title": "AnalyzeMoveRequest"
      },
      "AnalyzeMoveResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "requestId": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Requestid",
            "description": "请求标识"
          },
          "best": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EvalItem",
            "description": "引擎分析得出的最佳走法"
          },
          "played": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EvalItem"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "实战走出的走法评估"
          },
          "second": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EvalItem"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "第二候选走法，用于评估最佳走法是否明显突出"
          },
          "previousBest": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EvalItem"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "上一完成深度（depth-1）的最佳走法，用于评估评分稳定性"
          },
          "comparison": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ComparisonResult",
            "description": "同深度对比结果"
          },
          "opening": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpeningInfo"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "开局理论名称与体系识别信息"
          },
          "engine": {
            "additionalProperties": true,
            "type": "object",
            "title": "Engine",
            "description": "引擎版本与运行配置"
          },
          "stats": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EngineStats",
            "description": "耗时与搜索统计"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "best",
          "comparison",
          "engine",
          "stats"
        ],
        "title": "AnalyzeMoveResponse"
      },
      "ComparisonResult": {
        "properties": {
          "canCompare": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "title": "Cancompare",
            "description": "是否能在同深度下进行有效对比"
          },
          "commonDepth": {
            "type": "integer",
            "title": "Commondepth",
            "description": "共同完成深度（同深度比对基准）"
          },
          "diffCp": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Diffcp",
            "description": "厘兵亏损值：played.score - best.score。负值表示相较最佳着法的损失（厘兵，100 cp = 1 兵）。"
          },
          "diffWdlLoss": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Diffwdlloss",
            "description": "失败率增加值：played.loss - best.loss（千分比）"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "canCompare",
          "commonDepth"
        ],
        "title": "ComparisonResult"
      },
      "EngineStats": {
        "properties": {
          "nodes": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Nodes",
            "description": "搜索总节点数"
          },
          "nps": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Nps",
            "description": "每秒搜索节点数"
          },
          "hashfull": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Hashfull",
            "description": "置换表千分比占用"
          },
          "tbhits": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Tbhits",
            "description": "Syzygy 残局库命中次数"
          },
          "elapsedMs": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Elapsedms",
            "description": "总耗时（毫秒）"
          },
          "cached": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "title": "Cached",
            "description": "是否命中服务端 LRU 计算缓存",
            "default": false
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "title": "EngineStats"
      },
      "EvalItem": {
        "properties": {
          "move": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Move",
            "description": "UCI 格式着法，如 f1c4"
          },
          "depth": {
            "type": "integer",
            "title": "Depth",
            "description": "实际完成的计算深度"
          },
          "seldepth": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Seldepth",
            "description": "最大选择性搜索深度"
          },
          "score": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ScoreDetail"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "行棋方视角的局面评分"
          },
          "wdl": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/WdlDetail"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "胜平负千分比（总和 1000）"
          },
          "pv": {
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Pv",
            "description": "后续主变例走法列表（UCI 格式）"
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "depth"
        ],
        "title": "EvalItem"
      },
      "EvaluateRequest": {
        "properties": {
          "requestId": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Requestid",
            "description": "请求唯一标识。"
          },
          "position": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/PositionInput",
            "description": "待评估局面。"
          },
          "profile": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Profile",
            "description": "预设档位（lightning / fast / standard / deep / ultra）。",
            "default": "standard"
          },
          "limits": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MoveAnalysisLimits"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "搜索限制。"
          },
          "multiPv": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer",
                "maximum": 10.0,
                "minimum": 1.0
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Multipv",
            "description": "候选线数（若省略则继承 profile）。"
          },
          "maxPvPlies": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "integer",
                "maximum": 64.0,
                "minimum": 1.0
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Maxpvplies",
            "description": "PV 步数。",
            "default": 12
          }
        },
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "position"
        ],
        "title": "EvaluateRequest"
      },
      "EvaluateResponse": {
        "properties": {
          "requestId": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Requestid",
            "description": "请求标识"
          },
          "completedDepth": {
            "type": "integer",
            "title": "Completeddepth",
            "description": "实际完成深度"
          },
          "best": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EvalItem"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "description": "最佳走法"
          },
          "candidates": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EvalItem"
            },
            "type": "array",
            "title": "Candidates",
